  "note": "New package subpath ./rpc-endpoint whose only export is assertNodeRpcEndpoint({ rpcUrl, network, chainIdentity }), also exported from the root. It returns rpcUrl unchanged when the wire's canonicalNodeEndpoint admits it, passing chainIdentity on only for network 'testnet', and otherwise throws NetworkBindingError rpc_endpoint_invalid. network-binding.mjs now imports canonicalNodeEndpoint from the import-free @kynesyslabs/dacs/wire/node-endpoint leaf instead of the broad wire entry, so the subpath loads no wallet, signing, journal, transport or SQLite module; the binder's own endpoint rule is unchanged. The manifest pin in scripts/check-hold.mjs gains the new export, re-pinned with pin-delta.mjs."
